# Generated verification bundles (G9 hostile review, 2026-09-25).
#
# The evidence harness's esbuild outputs and its generated spec dump were
# committed at ~13.5 MB (logo-bundle.js alone is 53K lines). They are
# regenerable from the harness sources beside them, carry no review value
# beyond the receipts that cite them, and were stripped from the branch
# before its main merge. This file keeps a re-run of the harness from
# re-introducing them via a blanket `git add`.
evidence/harness/*bundle*.js
evidence/swan-mark.spec.json
